category: Libs
build-depends: cygport dbus-x11 libdbus1-devel libexpat-devel libglib2.0-devel libpopt-devel libsigc3.0-devel
sdesc: "C++ wrapper for dbus (utilities)"
ldesc: "DBus-cxx is a C++ implementation of the DBus protocol. DBus is a
Linux-specific RPC(remote procedure call) and IPC(inter-process communications)
mechanism."
